      "definition": "CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION public.current_portal_type()\n RETURNS text\n LANGUAGE sql\n STABLE SECURITY DEFINER\n SET search_path TO 'public'\nAS $function$\r\n  SELECT NULLIF(auth.jwt()->'app_metadata'->>'portal_type', '')\r\n$function$\n",
      "sha256": "0fb99f15f806cfa1e1dce0121d7e14458695a8e2fb9aefa7213868c232142dcb"
